          "memories": [
            {
              "content": "The user recorded a family dinner in the calendar for the final week of November.",
              "content_digest": "59755036ea9e7d172a5e673253fc7f089e61efe043b2e660f429fe2fa9003d34",
              "position": 0,
              "uid": "3f6eaf6c-00e7-5bd7-9809-367f54a0f707"
            },
            {
              "content": "In a crowded restaurant, the user had to ask several times for orders to be repeated, interrupting the flow of conversation.",
              "content_digest": "2d79e2f4f88a70bc8fbf9efca1b1751fbf51d88667f304c8e8c965a0a536cee7",
              "position": 1,
              "uid": "9fd0b9b6-986d-54b0-965e-45feaf9cd482"
            },
            {
              "content": "When the user held the next gathering at their father's home, they continued the conversation on the sofa after the meal.",
              "content_digest": "4b22fa055bb342db0589b0c54e415f4fa2af02445d3c55b3f38510bd6ca62f38",
              "position": 2,
              "uid": "cbc477c4-83c4-506b-9da8-9252d14d7f6b"
            },
            {
              "content": "At a gathering with loud music prepared by their older sister, the user developed a headache and went outside briefly.",
              "content_digest": "c9b34c3e3211ca7f15eb9a6f8ba97941222bc35ec0253d3da3f383c7247c3e83",
              "position": 3,
              "uid": "bbfc537e-3fcc-5065-ab93-4777bcdfc10c"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user held a yard barbecue with their younger brother, the open space dispersed the sound and made conversation easier.",
              "content_digest": "dd35056c7731d3249a3c2689ee9fb6bfe6974544e302630de6ea230378fea9eb",
              "position": 4,
              "uid": "b61367fa-dd17-5ff2-9d6b-f81f6123735a"
            },
            {
              "content": "After seeing a message that their maternal aunt would arrive at 5 p.m., the user delayed meal preparation by an hour.",
              "content_digest": "31992a8945bfacfc9422f3180b203865f951f200561cd23dad901ec795c5de10",
              "position": 5,
              "uid": "681cdbd5-595d-5211-914d-edfd9a6b130d"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user waited without knowing their maternal uncle's arrival time, they reheated the food twice.",
              "content_digest": "fae7c462a85e844648cb99419e6fdb3a2cd8c7721209ea49a40b4df597635176",
              "position": 6,
              "uid": "81c0c4e9-5ae4-5e8a-b11c-7d33032fd8ec"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user's maternal uncle considers it easier to time his departure when he knows the family meal's start time in advance.",
              "content_digest": "793f47adaa4c5274d15377b0f4adbc2415c0bd5243baf7a1c77c0d92e987a7e8",
              "position": 7,
              "uid": "56078821-34d0-540f-ae66-03bdd7bd1df3"
            },
            {
              "content": "Before scheduling a family meal, confirm the attendees' arrival times and the location with the user.",
              "content_digest": "d057fab5cbe97472da2a796114018a7491d20db6a826cd56943268f73ffeb792",
              "position": 8,
              "uid": "19c8ae40-1f5b-5fec-9538-e7bc7cfb036a"
            },
            {
              "content": "Available restaurant reservation times may diminish quickly during the year-end gathering season.",
              "content_digest": "7bfc817a42ab2d2c67ad04eae58fb3c86bbede15b7cc4ef431a75528bb425e7e",
              "position": 9,
              "uid": "3ea9fa3b-4411-55d0-ac90-2ed5515e6ef7"
            }
          ],
          "side": "REFERENCE",
          "uid": "a2fd0938-cb6e-4ac5-ad40-95a7c9adcd0a"
        },
        {
