          "memories": [
            {
              "content": "The user keeps a picnic mat on the bottom shelf of the entrance storage cabinet.",
              "content_digest": "c17479bd6a0f978f71b106b562507e702c3b84af5119be6bce48e4ee1664e728",
              "position": 0,
              "uid": "a9da4cfc-a6aa-51ae-9ec4-0de5c7a09227"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user went to the riverside, they sat in a place without shade and moved after an hour.",
              "content_digest": "f9ab1da828ca5af06cb8bf54fe85136e316f503dab465fad514ab5a3f8243633",
              "position": 1,
              "uid": "fa2735e1-f4af-57d3-a18c-795715b6715b"
            },
            {
              "content": "At the next outdoor meal, the user chose a place near a large tree and stayed for two hours.",
              "content_digest": "189b7d85561df45986a6b7c9fe681b5ef53b22ca1f5e83fa8d64a7d93b35a577",
              "position": 2,
              "uid": "3bd8b8f2-c5b4-5004-8b9e-e388cc26ea7a"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a hot day when the user brought only one bottle of water, they bought another drink partway through the outing.",
              "content_digest": "92aa494a12664105a4bffc50a9026fadbec78332f750636093ea82ecc68e9597",
              "position": 3,
              "uid": "c7c4b494-39a6-5f5c-b37f-51c5061ac926"
            },
            {
              "content": "On the next outing, the user brought two small bottles of water after freezing them.",
              "content_digest": "69b3035b57b58b1aa778bd0da75dc806c1c449e7e35dc448aff92f7499c3148d",
              "position": 4,
              "uid": "dd9f5b3c-9c2e-5dbc-bf6e-eb7761eeb075"
            },
            {
              "content": "When meeting their maternal uncle at a park, the user and the uncle waited at different entrances for 15 minutes.",
              "content_digest": "9785e87b9fe79813762eb2e19e6d4f256a55f4799c92d095aaf695a8a1de5851",
              "position": 5,
              "uid": "2ed2a41c-f6ae-54d6-875c-a195d8fdacee"
            },
            {
              "content": "For the next meeting, the user sent a photo of the entrance sign, and they met at the same place.",
              "content_digest": "de40b6b7df84784639b97cf7ce153ad8af6e77320d75f3869979e5e3d39169e2",
              "position": 6,
              "uid": "23f3a4fc-d51e-5d0b-87f0-d5be407a57f3"
            },
            {
              "content": "For a park meeting, the user's maternal uncle prefers an entrance that requires less walking from the parking area.",
              "content_digest": "552a43b869c6f06cbf571f794106727406d87841d43addc92f31a3532f73d6f3",
              "position": 7,
              "uid": "e9f459f3-8ff0-5a0e-b78b-eda8d18b914e"
            },
            {
              "content": "When making an outdoor plan, confirm the exact entrance and an alternative location in case of rain.",
              "content_digest": "a265a6364c182de35363b58135b1da60d11595d1e3e0029f6851ac272261a959",
              "position": 8,
              "uid": "70277b86-d5db-5b58-8a94-e77372d15a4c"
            },
            {
              "content": "Some park restrooms and drinking fountains may be closed seasonally.",
              "content_digest": "8e5c4f5f85d4d27dc2211f46e3ab3bbed7f3d9687070b9028992b670986b09ca",
              "position": 9,
              "uid": "5a54437b-9b0e-5103-860d-d878be70b3ef"
            }
